veiland (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add opt-in fingerprint unlock ([fingerprint] enabled = true): a second
    PAM service, veiland-fingerprint, runs pam_fprintd alongside the
    password check, so a touch unlocks and the password keeps working.
    The package ships /etc/pam.d/veiland-fingerprint. Needs fprintd with
    an enrolled finger.
  * Render lock surfaces at physical resolution on scaled outputs (via
    wp_viewporter), so the lock screen is no longer blurry at fractional
    or integer scales. Config pixel values stay logical, so existing
    configs look the same, only sharp.
  * Add a deepfield-corners example scene: a shader backdrop framed by the
    clock, status chips, weather and now-playing widgets.

 -- sylflo <veiland@sylvain-chateau.com>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

veiland (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging-only release: nothing in veiland itself changed since 0.3.0 --
    no core, protocol, SDK or plugin code was touched. The one fix was
    NixOS-only (the Python plugins could not load libgbm there) and does not
    affect this package.

 -- sylflo <veiland@sylvain-chateau.com>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

veiland (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add veiland-shader, which runs a Shadertoy-convention GLSL fragment
    shader as a full-region layer: seven embedded presets (nebula,
    deepfield, starfield, moon, meteor, warp, plasma) or a user .frag
    via path. Bad content draws a dark fill instead of exiting, and
    --check compiles a shader without locking the screen.
  * Add a Deep Field astronomy example scene, built from four shader
    layers and the markup widget with no image asset.
  * Add a {jd} Julian Day Number token to the markup widget.
  * Add GbmEgl::new_es3 to veiland-plugin, for plugins whose shaders
    need GLES 3.

 -- sylflo <veiland@sylvain-chateau.com>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0000

veiland (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a Python plugin tier: an SDK plus nine widgets installed as veiland-*
    commands (markup, weather, now-playing, avatar, wifi, ethernet, bluetooth,
    battery, shape).
  * Add wallpaper blur/darken/frosted regions, anchored region placement
    (halign/valign with fraction-of-surface sizing), --help/--version, and
    particle twinkle.
  * Authenticate with pam_authenticate only; the account phase is no longer
    run and the shipped PAM file drops its account line.
  * Remove the clock and label plugins; the markup widget replaces both.
  * Fix CPU-plugin flicker, black external-only dmabufs, and text atlas
    glyph bleed.

 -- sylflo <veiland@sylvain-chateau.com>  Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0000

veiland (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: veiland-core + reference plugins, bundled PAM service.
  * Run PAM authentication on a worker thread so a wrong password no longer
    freezes the animation.

 -- sylflo <veiland@sylvain-chateau.com>  Sat, 04 Jul 2026 18:00:00 +0000
